flowchart LR
  Brief[Approved learning objective]
  Prompt[Versioned generation prompt]
  Draft[LLM content draft]
  Auto[Automated checks: schema, duplicates, language, safety]
  License[Source and license verification]
  Review[Human language reviewer]
  Reject[Reject / revise with reason]
  Publish[Publish immutable content version]
  Catalog[(Curated content catalog)]
  Evidence[(Source, reviewer, model, QA evidence)]
  Rollback[Deprecate / rollback version]

  Brief --> Prompt --> Draft --> Auto
  Auto -->|fails| Reject
  Auto -->|passes| License
  License -->|unclear| Reject
  License -->|verified| Review
  Review -->|fails| Reject
  Review -->|approved| Publish --> Catalog
  Publish --> Evidence
  Catalog --> Rollback
  Rollback --> Evidence
